      "summary": "By pressing the 'I AM OF LEGAL AGE' button, I agree that I am of legal age for smoking and drinking in my country. Abe Flores, PDR Cigars, released at the Intertabac 2026 his new Small Batch Reserve, a novelty series featuring two distinct expressions, ready for international markets: first one with an Ecuadorian Habano wrapper, in a red band, and the other with a Broadleaf Maduro wrapper, in a blue band. Both use a Sumatra binder and a blend of Dominican and Broadleaf leaves in the filler. The new Small Batch Reserve comes in trendy formats—short, thick ring-gauge cigars (102 mm x 60 / 4x60)—and features a very classic cigar presentation: cabinet 25-count boxes with sliding lids.",
